msgctxt "236"
msgid "No way..."
msgstr "Non è possibile..."

msgctxt "248"
msgid "That means..."
msgstr "Quell'uomo..."

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Yes... You people are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You're... Natsume, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Good. You remembered me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"I didn't expect you to mature this much during my little\r\n"
"tropical excursion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Still, I have my pride as top hostess to defend. Soooo...\r\n"
"We're gonna have a contest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "A contest? How's that supposed to work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"It's simple. You just need to train someone to be the best\r\n"
"there is. I'm talking about a number one hostess here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"Fashionable from head to toe, rigorously trained, motivated\r\n"
"out the wazoo, yet calm and composed... Those are just the\r\n"
"minimum requirements to compete with a girl like me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Got all that down? Then let the battle begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Coordinate your hostess's appearance and train her to the\r\n"
"limit to make her a cabaret superstar. Let nothing hold her\r\n"
"back from being number one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "All right, then. Let's aim for the top!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "You said your name was %s? You're actually not half bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Thank you very much."
msgstr "Grazie mille."

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you can become a top-ranking hostess at the rate\r\n"
"you're going. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Not bad at all, people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "And you are...?"
msgstr "E tu saresti...?"

msgctxt "668"
msgid "I'm Aiko."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Nice to meet you."
msgstr "Piacere di conoscerti."

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Uh-huh. You know what our goal is, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "That would be... to please the customers, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "That's just a means to an end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"In the end, a hostess's value depends entirely on the money\r\n"
"she brings in. That's just the way it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"If you were a club hostess, you'd need to make 100,000 yen\r\n"
"for every three guests you entertain. Minimum."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Don't you think that's asking a bit much?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Not really. A girl who can't even manage that can never hope\r\n"
"to make it to the top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Fine. Then that's just what we'll do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Good. I'm glad you understand. 'Cause in this kinda\r\n"
"business... only the strong survive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Well then. Let's see what you got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Earn enough money to blow other cabaret clubs right out of\r\n"
"the water! Of course, your hostess is only competing against\r\n"
"her peers right now, but she still needs to rake in the\r\n"
"profit. Keep trying and eventually she'll get there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "All right. Let's step up our game and bring in the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "That's amazing, %s-san! You finally got a Super Service!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "It's all thanks to everyone's support."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna keep on rooting for you, so do your best to become\r\n"
"number one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"Girl, you've been working it lately! Yeah, I've seen you out\r\n"
"there! You too, big boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "And you might be...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "I'm Nana. Nice to meetcha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Ah. Likewise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "So! Have you ever seen a Super Service before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "Super Service? No, I don't believe I have."
msgstr "Super Servizio? No, non credo."

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"Well... Hmm, how should I put it? It's like, that moment\r\n"
"when your service makes such a huge impact on a customer,\r\n"
"it's like the stars are aligned... and everything stops..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"It's the kinda thing that happens when you're in tip-top\r\n"
"shape. I'm talking good condition, perfect coordination,\r\n"
"superior service stats... Stuff that makes ya stand out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "I think I get the picture..."
msgstr "Penso di aver capito il quadro..."

msgctxt "1136"
msgid ""
"Seeing a Super Service happen in its natural environment\r\n"
"is how you know your club is off the chain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid ""
"I see. So if we train and dress our hostesses well, we'll\r\n"
"be able to pull off this \"Super Service\" you speak of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "1172"
msgid ""
"Now, there might be times you can pull it off even if you're\r\n"
"not in top form, so don't get too ahead of yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid ""
"All right, then we'll make sure our hospitality is good\r\n"
"enough to perform a Super Service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid ""
"Well, well. Looks like you got the hang of training after\r\n"
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid ""
"%s-san is shaping up to be quite the hostess.\r\n"
"And Kiryu-san, you've got the makings of a great coach.\r\n"
"Guess the rumors were true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "1304"
msgid ""
"Sure. It's exciting to see someone rise up in our industry.\r\n"
"Just don't fall off the boat while going full speed ahead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid "Oh, is this the girl I've heard so much about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "Hm? Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid ""
"Keiko. What more do you need to know? Anyway, I hear you're\r\n"
"aiming to take the number one spot here. That's pretty edgy\r\n"
"for a couple of newcomers... You must be quite talented."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid "More or less."
msgstr "Più o meno."

msgctxt "1436"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well I can tell you're both pretty new at this. Your\r\n"
"hospitality's... missing something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr "Davvero...?"

msgctxt "1460"
msgid ""
"Mhm. A hostess's service skills are her livelihood, you see.\r\n"
"You'll need to work with what she's got to reach the top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid ""
"That said, you should be training as much as you can during\r\n"
"your downtime. And match your customers' preferences."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid ""
"So what you're saying is, I should be inspecting the\r\n"
"customers in the club, then training during break?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid ""
"That's exactly it. Oh, but don't always train the same skill! Variety's the "
"spice of life, after all. Now get out there and make some magic happen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid ""
"Giving good customer service can be broken down into two\r\n"
"simple steps: First, walk around the club and observe your\r\n"
"customers' preferences, then head to the break room and\r\n"
"give your hostess some training. That's all there is to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid "All right. Let's get right to it, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid ""
"Way to go, %s-san! You've really got a nice aesthetic there, and I know for "
"a fact the customers noticed, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1616"
msgid "Keep up the good work, and you'll be number one in no time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1628"
msgid "Thanks for your support."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1640"
msgid "Of course! We hostesses gotta stick together, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1712"
msgid "Oh, is that the new girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1736"
msgid "Yeah... And you are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1748"
msgid ""
"I'm Aya... Ah, and you must be the new guy... I guess that\r\n"
"makes me your senpai!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1760"
msgid ""
"Hmm, I suppose I should teach you the tricks of the trade\r\n"
"to help this job go smoothly. Otherwise, I wouldn't be much\r\n"
"of a senpai, now would I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1772"
msgid ""
"So, when it comes to doing well as a hostess, customer\r\n"
"satisfaction is everything. Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1784"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "1796"
msgid ""
"That's why it's important to get a grasp on the customers'\r\n"
"preferences and do your best to satisfy them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1808"
msgid ""
"You should be able to get an idea of what the guests want\r\n"
"when you walk the floor. Anyway, just get out there and see\r\n"
"what you can learn. Use your eyes and ears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1820"
msgid ""
"So you're saying that I should gather information and\r\n"
"coordinate %s's attributes and appearance?\r\n"
"That way she can better satisfy the customers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1832"
msgid "Yup. Hehe, am I being a little too much?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1844"
msgid ""
"Either way, do your best and don't get stressed! Both of\r\n"
"you guys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1904"
msgid ""
"Get a feel for your customers' preferences by walking around\r\n"
"the club, then return to the break room and coordinate your\r\n"
"hostess to fit their ideal image."
msgstr ""
"Fatti un'idea delle preferenze dei clienti girando per il locale, poi torna "
"nel camerino e coordina l'aspetto della tua hostess per adattarlo alla loro "
"immagine ideale."

msgctxt "1916"
msgid "All right, time to hit the floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1952"
msgid "Oh... You people are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1976"
msgid "You're... Natsume, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1988"
msgid "Good. You remembered me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2000"
msgid ""
"I didn't expect you to mature this much during my little\r\n"
"tropical excursion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2012"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2024"
msgid ""
"Still, I have my pride as top hostess to defend. Soooo...\r\n"
"We're gonna have a contest!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2036"
msgid "A contest? How's that supposed to work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2048"
msgid ""
"It's simple. You just need to train someone to be the best\r\n"
"there is. I'm talking about a number one hostess here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2060"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2072"
msgid ""
"Fashionable from head to toe, rigorously trained, motivated\r\n"
"out the wazoo, yet calm and composed... Those are just the\r\n"
"minimum requirements to compete with a girl like me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2084"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2096"
msgid "Got all that down? Then let the battle begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2156"
msgid ""
"Aim to make your hostess number one in the nightlife game\r\n"
"by coordinating her appearance and teaching her the ways of\r\n"
"hospitality through training!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2168"
msgid "All right, time to hit the floor."
msgstr ""

